        "desc": "Half-substance, half-shadow, high walls rise to the distant roof of the Halls.\nFar above, just below the roof, many narrow windows have been cut in the shadowy\nfabric. Through these windows golden and silvery light enters the Halls and\nstrange scents and whispers drift in. Some of these whispers speak of strange\nlands and things; others are in no language of Middle-earth that you can\nrecognise.\n",
